  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.1.0 - Creation, editing and reading in one package: SharpCorePDF depends on the four layers and carries no assemblies of its own. Adds page authoring with embedded fonts and PNG images, page editing (rotate, delete, move, duplicate, crop, resize, extract, split, import, append, metadata), layout reading with ALTO/PAGE XML/hOCR/SVG export, digital signatures and PDF/A-1b/-2b/-3b output. Both legs (net10.0, net11.0) ship in one package. Details: https://github.com/MPCoreDeveloper/SharpCorePDF/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
